## 9. 空状态

### 9.1 没有任何活动

No activity yet.
Once devices become active and users join the challenge, revenue and coupon data will appear here.

### 9.2 有激活设备但没有参与

Devices are active, but no users have joined the challenge yet.

### 9.3 有参与但没有收入

Users have started joining the challenge, but no coupon revenue has been generated yet.

### 9.4 有获得券但没有使用

Coupons have been earned, but none have been used yet.

### 9.5 Shopify 未连接

Connect Shopify to track coupon usage, orders, and revenue.

未连接 Shopify 时，不展示订单和收入假数据。

