## 12. 最终页面信息架构

新版 Brand Dashboard 最终结构为：

1. Date Filter

2. Revenue Overview

   * Challenge attributed revenue / Coupon revenue
   * Repeat customer revenue
   * Revenue per active user / Active users
   * Revenue growth
   * Coupon order revenue / Orders
   * Repeat purchase rate
   * 30-day retention
   * Winback rate

3. Coupon Revenue Funnel

   * Active devices
   * Participants
   * Coupons earned
   * Coupons used
   * Orders
   * Coupon revenue

4. Coupon Performance

   * By coupon tier

5. Revenue Trend

   * Challenge attributed revenue
   * Coupon revenue

